{
  "feature": "Card scanning close-out: every scanner state at both widths",
  "clearAbout": true,
  "note": "Needs CARD_SCAN_ENABLED=true and COLLECTION_EDIT_ENABLED=true on the server, network (Scryfall art, the detector and embedder, onnxruntime-web), Chromium's fake camera playing Sol Ring, and SCAN_PHOTOS_DIR naming a folder holding the three photos the photos row picks. The match endpoint is answered by `mock`, so each state is staged without an index: sure (Sol Ring, many printings), sure with one printing (Greta, Sweettooth Scourge), not sure (margin 0.02), and not ready (503 no-index). Oracle and printing ids are local-dev's. Nothing is saved: every row stops before Save, so nothing is written.",
